ose with an existing level, `entries_in_chapter()` a chapter's levels): a new chapter needs a `CHAPTERS` row. `LevelCatalog.entries()` skips a row whose scene file doesn't exist, with a warning. The menu emits the id and `Game.load_level(id)` closes the menu (unpausing), discards the checkpoint (`restart_level()` semantics) and loads it, or restarts when the pick is the current level (marked by `Game.current_level_id`). Replace the whole scene when real UI exists.
